                      00023 ;--------------------------------------------------------------
01B5   30F9           00024 onems   MOVLW   D'249'          ; Count for 1ms delay 
01B6   00F0           00025                 MOVWF   Timer1          ; Load count    2 + (1 + 1 + 2) * 248 + 1 + 2 + 2
01B7   0000           00026 loop1   NOP                     ; Pad for 4 cycle loop
Message[305]: Using default destination of 1 (file).
01B8   0BF0           00027                 DECFSZ  Timer1          ; Count
01B9   29B7           00028                 GOTO    loop1           ; until Z
