01C2   1108           00046         BCF     PORTD,E         ; Reset E low
01C3   21B5           00047         CALL    onems           ; Delay 1ms
01C4   0008           00048         RETURN                  ; done
                      00049 
                      00050 ;--------------------------------------------------------------
